bash

- Git clone in sgoinfre as mobileModule04
- Access the repo with VSCode
- Add 3 env files zith local data
- Open 2 terminals
- source ./startLinux.sh in both 2 terminals
- npm i in diary_app and diary_app/backend

in diary_app/backend : node reset-db.ts, node create-user.ts, node server.ts
in diary_app :

- npx expo install expo-dev-client
- npx expo run:android
- npx expo start --clear --tunnel
  s - switch to development build for auth

/!\ Make sure your device is connected to the same WiFi as your computer

to free space: rm -rf "$HOME/.gradle"
